        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur's Preschool is the perfect combination of learning, fun, and helpful features. With 9 exciting learning activities and over 20 creative activities, Arthur's Preschool teaches a full year's worth of preschool skills and entertains your child with limitless fun and learning!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Creator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and print your own greeting cards and send them to friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shapes &amp; Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the right color and size to put shadow shapes together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Personalization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur knows your name, favorite animal and color—he even knows your birthday!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kids Learn</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Letter Names &amp; Sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vocabulary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numbers &amp; Counting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching &amp; Sorting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Arithmetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arts &amp; Crafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing &amp; Coloring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes &amp; Colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recognizing Differences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following Directions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Skill Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Leveling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress Reports</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Help Messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Printable Activities</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur's Preschool is the perfect combination of learning, fun, and helpful features. With 9 exciting learning activities and over 20 creative activities, Arthur's Preschool teaches a full year's worth of preschool skills and entertains your child with limitless fun and learning!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Creator</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and print your own greeting cards and send them to friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shapes &amp; Colors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select the right color and size to put shadow shapes together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Personalization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arthur knows your name, favorite animal and color—he even knows your birthday!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kids Learn</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Letter Names &amp; Sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vocabulary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numbers &amp; Counting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching &amp; Sorting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Arithmetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music Composition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arts &amp; Crafts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing &amp; Coloring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shapes &amp; Colors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recognizing Differences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following Directions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Special Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Skill Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-Leveling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress Reports</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Help Messages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Printable Activities</p></li></ul>",
